msgstr "事实来源"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:8
#: 2e7286b5681b47b29773479407793fe3
msgid ""
"`/fsm_command` is **`std_msgs/Int32`**, not `String`. There is no "
"documented `/mode_command`, `/fsm_state` String, or wheeled-arm `stand` /"
" `walk` / `arm_teleop` contract. Per-controller topics: the controller "
"pages and package READMEs."
msgstr ""
"`/fsm_command` 是 **`std_msgs/Int32`**，不是 `String`。没有文档化的 "
"`/mode_command`、`/fsm_state` String，或轮臂人形的 `stand` / `walk` / "
"`arm_teleop` 约定。各控制器话题见对应页面和软件包 README。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:11
#: b0bbea7b24ed40558a9ef5a4e3f7e623
