#: ../../source/3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md:13
#: 8753448bf1e04baebbb67762e16a75c6
msgid ""
"`FSMCommandPublisher` publishes `std_msgs/Int32` on `/fsm_command`. "
"Header values: `1` HOME, `2` HOLD, `3` OCS2, `4` MOVEJ (`100` switches "
"HOME pose)."
msgstr ""
"`FSMCommandPublisher` 向 `/fsm_command` 发布 `std_msgs/Int32`。头文件中的值：`1` "
"HOME，`2` HOLD，`3` OCS2，`4` MOVEJ（`100` 切换 HOME 构型）。"

